That's incorrect. It's not my reader that filters spam, but my Usenet
provider.

Usenet provider usually automatically cancel postings that are
considered spam. There are several methods to categorize a posting as
spam (e.g. the Breidbart Index, Cleanfeed).

Google has chosen to not only to ignore those well established methods
to counter Usenet spam but they also implemented a rather useless
"Report posting" feature.

